OL,3,GNEWSABurning the Clocks parade
OL,4,Acancelled for second year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe annual Burning the Clocks parade in
OL,7,FBrighton will not take place for a
OL,8,Fsecond year running due to a lack of
OL,9,Ffunding, organisers have announced.
OL,11,FThis event, which celebrates the winter
OL,12,Fsolstice, was meant to return this year
OL,13,Fafter a fallow year in 2025, but
OL,14,Forganiser Same Sky said it could not
OL,15,Fafford the nearly #60,000 it cost to
OL,16,Frun.
OL,18,FInstead, lanterns made in community
OL,19,Fworkshops at local schools will light
OL,20,Fup Moulsecoomb Place on the winter
OL,21,Fsolstice.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
