OL,3,GNEWSABurning the Clocks parade
OL,4,Acancelled for second year
OL,5,
OL,6,FExecutive director Amy Keogh said the
OL,7,Fcharity "desperately" wanted to bring
OL,8,Fback a parade which meant "so much to
OL,9,Fus, to our city, to the communities
OL,10,Finvolved" but is financially
OL,11,Fconstrained.
